<Article h1={"Privacy and your choices"} subtitle={"You can use the free tools without an account or analytics consent."} crumbs={[{"name":"Privacy"}]} title="Privacy & Analytics Choices | DeadHangs" description="How DeadHangs handles analytics choices, local training logs, optional email signup and affiliate links.">
<div class="article-body"><p>Updated 31 October 2026. DeadHangs is operated by Sunny Patel. Contact <a href="mailto:hello@sunnypatel.co.uk">hello@sunnypatel.co.uk</a> about this page or a data request.</p><h2>Training log, goal and calculator</h2><p>The training log stores dates, hold times, assistance types, set counts and any setup you record (bar, grip, chalk and added load) in this browser's local storage when you choose to save an entry. A saved goal and session settings are stored separately in this browser only when you choose Save plan. These entries and settings are not uploaded by the tool or sent to Google Analytics. Other people using the same browser profile may be able to see them. The log provides export, individual deletion and clear-all controls.</p><p>Clearing site data or switching browser profiles can remove access to your log. The log has no cloud backup or account sync. The calculator uses your entries on the current page. Choosing Review this goal in the timer keeps your target and hold in this browser only long enough to open the setup tool. It does not save a plan or log entry.</p><h2>Offline use</h2><p>Your browser keeps a copy of the timer page and its files so the timer works without a connection. This copy holds site files only, not your log. Clearing site data removes it.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics loads only after you accept analytics on this site. It measures visits, page activity and tagged equipment-link clicks. Training-tool custom measurements use only a page pathname, tool source, the name of the feature used (for example "max test started" or "bar card printed") and, where relevant, timer mode. They do not include hold times, targets, ages, setups, assistance, dates, log IDs, form values or full URLs. Google may process online identifiers and technical data according to its own policies. Google Analytics data is not anonymous.</p><p>You can change your choice below or in the footer. Declining prevents further measurement through this site's configured Google Analytics tag and clears its first-party analytics cookies where accessible. It does not delete data already processed by Google.</p><button type="button" class="dh-btn" data-open-consent>Change analytics choice</button><p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Optional email signup</h2><p>An email signup form sends your email address to Brevo to manage the subscription. The signup also records a signup date and email-sequence status. Training-log entries are not attached. Use the unsubscribe link in a received message or contact us to request removal.</p><p>The printable session planner is available directly without subscribing. A successful signup message confirms registration but not delivery to your inbox. <a href="https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/">Brevo privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>The contact link opens your mail app. A message you send gives us its content and the sender details from your email service. We use them to respond. Include only information needed for your inquiry.</p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Clearly marked Amazon links take you to Amazon, which may send you to your local Amazon store. Amazon may use its own cookies and process information under its policies after you visit. As an Amazon Associate, DeadHangs.com earns from qualifying purchases.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>Cloudflare serves this site and may process request information for delivery, reliability and security. This is separate from optional Google Analytics.</p><p><a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Requests and retention</h2><p>Delete local training entries with the controls in the tool. Contact us about information sent by email or subscription forms. We will respond to applicable access, correction, deletion or objection requests. Exact analytics retention is controlled in the Google Analytics account and is not stated here without verification.</p></div></Article>
